 BNOSE=1.,BTAIL=1.,BLN=3.,BLA=3.,DS=0.$
CASEID CONE NOSE, FLARE
SAVE
NEXT CASE
 $BODY METHOD=2.$
CASEID METHOD 2 USES SYPBOD WITH HYPERS
NEXT CASE
